error[E0071]: literal out of range for `Int` on the `js` target
  --> tests/ui/13-tooling/check_target/js_range_literal_on_js.cheby:11:13
   |
11 |   let big = 9_007_199_254_740_993
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `9007199254740993` does not fit in `Int` on JS
